# Pencil design file access

**`Moventiq.pen`** (repo root) is **encrypted**. Do not use Read, Grep, or text editors on any `.pen` file.

Use **Pencil MCP** tools only:

- `get_editor_state` (with schema) — discover file structure
- `batch_get` — read screen/component nodes
- `get_screenshot` — visual reference
- `batch_design` — create or edit design nodes

Visual spec: rendered screens in `Moventiq.pen`. Numeric spec: [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md).
